# NOTICE

`mcp-multiplexer` is an independent implementation.

The strict multiplexer idea, the `base` selector, and part of the configuration
vocabulary were informed by:

- **router-1c-mcp** — https://github.com/Regsorm/router-1c-mcp (MIT).
  Its tool-catalog/matrix design and `bases.json` format were used as a reference.
  This project is not a fork and does not copy its Rust source.
- **MCPHub** — https://github.com/samanhappy/mcphub (Apache-2.0).
  Groups, namespacing and Smart Routing were used as the integration context.
- **reaatech/mcp-gateway** — https://github.com/reaatech/mcp-gateway (MIT).
  Its `all-wait` fan-out vocabulary informed the optional fan-out result shape.

